  abilityDesc: 21 combo massive Earth attack on all foes (partial HP drain), hugely
    boosts max HP, negates critical and elemental damage for 5 turns, 50% reduction
    to Spark damage for 5 turns, enormously boosts BB gauge for 3 turns & damage
    taken enormously restores HP for 3 turns
